SLOOP 3 web editor (web/editor.html), from https://github.com/isod89/sloop3-fm1 tag v3.3.7-beta (commit 915b54f6780564cb486b4de8a518aabbea1503a0).
GPL-3.0 (LICENSE beside this file). SLOOP 3 is by isod89 (the SLOOP project); its README says: new code,
written for this project; the values of its factory sounds, kits and presets are SLOOP 2.8.5's
(https://github.com/isod89/sloop-fm1, GPL-3.0), whose earlier versions were based on Felucca by Leo Kuroshita
(Hügelton Instruments).
editor.html is the upstream file, byte for byte: FM-1 Companion's tools/bundle_sloop3_editor.py checks that
the tag's own tools/mkeditor.py builds exactly this file from the tag's web/src. Nothing in it is changed.
compat-chromium102.js is NOT part of SLOOP 3: it is FM-1 Companion's own small addition (GPL-3.0-only), run by the
app after the editor has loaded, for the older Chromium of Qt 6.4 (see the file).
The firmware itself, m-bootloader and the installer page are not bundled.

